; Logical F64 Constant : ONE exact double scalar — a true RANK-0 tensor
; (empty shape), never a length-1 vector. Separate from LogicalConstant
; (F32 by its parity rule) so `0.1f64`/`1e300` cross the pipeline at full
; double precision. Congruence dedupes equal values.
(constructor LogicalConstantF64 (f64) LogicalTensor)
